  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "綠色金融",
    "sub_ename": "GREEN FINANCE",
    "describe_ch": "此課程將介紹綠色金融的相關知識，探討永續發展與金融之間的關係，以及綠色金融如何透過金融工具來幫助企業和投資人實現環境和社會效益。本課程希望協助同學對綠色金融與永續金融能有基本的認知；同時也希望透過本課程將綠色金融相關的商品與法規介紹給同學。",
    "describe_eh": "This course will introduce the knowledge of green finance, explore the relationship between sustainable development and finance, and discuss how green finance can help enterprises and investors achieve environmental and social benefits through financial instruments. The objective of this course is to help students to learn about basic concepts of green finance and sustainable finance. Moreover, this course also introduces regarding green finance related commodities and regulations to students.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
